window.LPHelpContent={eyebrow:{es:"LearnFlow \xB7 Ayuda",en:"LearnFlow \xB7 Help"},title:{es:"\xBFC\xF3mo funciona LearnFlow?",en:"How does LearnFlow work?"},intro:{es:"El portal combina tu actividad en FluentFlow, HubFlow y LyricFlow bajo un mismo nivel CEFR (A1\u2013C2). Esta gu\xEDa explica los cuatro mecanismos que gobiernan tu progreso: el nivel, el progreso combinado, c\xF3mo se sube de nivel y la racha.",en:"The portal combines your activity across FluentFlow, HubFlow, and LyricFlow under one CEFR level (A1\u2013C2). This guide explains the four mechanisms behind your progress: your level, combined progress, leveling up, and the streak."},sections:[{id:"cefr-level",mark:"A\u2013C",markClass:"portal",name:{es:"Nivel CEFR",en:"CEFR level"},tag:{es:"Tu punto de partida",en:"Your starting point"},summary:{es:"Tu ingl\xE9s se ubica en la escala CEFR, de A1 a C2. Ese nivel activo determina qu\xE9 contenido ves en las tres apps.",en:"Your English is placed on the CEFR scale, from A1 to C2. That active level determines what content you see across the three apps."},points:[{es:"El nivel inicial se define con un test de nivelaci\xF3n al crear tu cuenta; pod\xE9s repetirlo si quer\xE9s recalibrarlo.",en:"Your initial level is set with a placement test when you create your account; you can retake it to recalibrate."},{es:"Todo el contenido de tu nivel y los anteriores queda desbloqueado \u2014 no pod\xE9s saltar a contenido de un nivel superior al activo.",en:"All content from your level and earlier stays unlocked \u2014 you can't skip ahead to content above your active level."},{es:'Al completar C2 se desbloquea contenido adicional fuera de la escala CEFR (por ejemplo, canciones "FR" en LyricFlow).',en:'Completing C2 unlocks extra content outside the CEFR scale (for example, "FR" songs in LyricFlow).'}],open:!0},{id:"combined-progress",mark:"%",markClass:"fluent",name:{es:"Progreso combinado",en:"Combined progress"},tag:{es:"El anillo del portal",en:"The portal ring"},summary:{es:"El portal combina tu actividad en FluentFlow, HubFlow y LyricFlow en un solo n\xFAmero.",en:"The portal combines your activity across FluentFlow, HubFlow, and LyricFlow into a single number."},points:[{es:"El anillo principal promedia el % de contenido completado en las tres apps, sobre todo el rango A1\u2013C2.",en:"The main ring averages the % of content completed across the three apps, over the full A1\u2013C2 range."},{es:"Cada app tambi\xE9n muestra su propio avance dentro del nivel activo \u2014 ese es el que cuenta para subir de nivel.",en:"Each app also shows its own progress within your active level \u2014 that's the one that counts toward leveling up."},{es:'Si alguna app todav\xEDa no carg\xF3 datos, el portal muestra progreso parcial (por ejemplo "2 de 3 fuentes") en vez de esperar.',en:`If an app hasn't loaded data yet, the portal shows partial progress (e.g. "2 of 3 sources") instead of waiting.`}]},{id:"level-up",mark:"\u2191",markClass:"hub",name:{es:"Subir de nivel",en:"Leveling up"},tag:{es:"La condici\xF3n de ascenso",en:"The advancement rule"},summary:{es:"Para pasar al siguiente nivel CEFR, las tres apps deben alcanzar su umbral dentro del nivel activo.",en:"To move to the next CEFR level, all three apps must reach their threshold within the active level."},points:[{es:"FluentFlow al {{fluentflow}}%, LyricFlow al {{lyricflow}}% y HubFlow al {{hubflow}}% del nivel activo.",en:"FluentFlow at {{fluentflow}}%, LyricFlow at {{lyricflow}}%, and HubFlow at {{hubflow}}% of the active level."},{es:"El ascenso es autom\xE1tico: apenas se cumplen los tres umbrales, tu nivel activo avanza sin que tengas que confirmarlo.",en:"The advancement is automatic: as soon as all three thresholds are met, your active level moves up without needing confirmation."},{es:"Pod\xE9s ajustar estos umbrales en Ajustes \u2192 Configuraci\xF3n avanzada.",en:"You can adjust these thresholds in Settings \u2192 Advanced configuration."}]},{id:"streak",mark:"\u{1F525}",markClass:"lyric",name:{es:"Racha",en:"Streak"},tag:{es:"Constancia diaria",en:"Daily consistency"},summary:{es:"La racha mide d\xEDas consecutivos con actividad, sin importar en cu\xE1l de las tres apps.",en:"The streak measures consecutive days with activity, regardless of which of the three apps."},points:[{es:"Cuenta cualquier evento v\xE1lido en FluentFlow, HubFlow o LyricFlow \u2014 hasta un intento fallido ya suma como uso real.",en:"Any valid event in FluentFlow, HubFlow, or LyricFlow counts \u2014 even a failed attempt already counts as real use."},{es:"Si todav\xEDa no practicaste hoy, la racha no se corta de inmediato: sigue contando desde ayer hasta que termine el d\xEDa.",en:"If you haven't practiced today yet, the streak doesn't break immediately \u2014 it keeps counting from yesterday until the day ends."},{es:"Se rompe al pasar un d\xEDa calendario completo sin actividad en ninguna de las tres apps.",en:"It breaks once a full calendar day passes with no activity in any of the three apps."}]}]};
